        "SourceText": "\u0022WE FOUGHT HIM ALONGSIDE WHAT VILLAINS WERE LEFT. ALL OF US, A FINAL WAR, BUT WE LOST. HES BEYOND POWERFUL. HE HAS THE ANTI-LIFE EQUATION, AND HAS TAKEN OVER THE EAST COAST WITH IT.",
